plier: 50 } "],["Accept-CH","Downlink,RTT,Sec-CH-UA-Form-Factors,Sec-CH-UA-Platform,Sec-CH-UA-Platform-Version,Sec-CH-UA-Full-Version,Sec-CH-UA-Arch,Sec-CH-UA-Model,Sec-CH-UA-Bitness,Sec-CH-UA-Full-Version-List,Sec-CH-UA-WoW64"],["Permissions-Policy","unload\u003d()"],["P3P","CP\u003d\"This is not a P3P policy! See g.co/p3phelp for more info.\""],["Content-Disposition","attachment; filename\u003d\"f.txt\""],["Content-Encoding","gzip"],["Transfer-Encoding","chunked"],["Server","gws"],["X-XSS-Protection","0"],["X-Frame-Options","SAMEORIGIN"]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,[[null,4,["7 months ago",null,"1772391367100"],["pit \u0026 pon","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWyMGccB4o4wK8nOXWkzie9iQ8YxFmkM2TbAVKwmDHfPzB9S00\u003ds64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100356873384583317650/reviews?hl\u003den-IN",134,844,[null,1]],[null,"7 months ago","Hi Yvonne!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe're so happy you enjoyed the dulce de leche ice cream and our cream cheese pastry! It's wonderful to know you found everything to your liking and would super recommend us.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe also really appreciate your feedback about the music. We want all our guests to feel comfortable, and we'll certainly take your comments about the volume into consideration for a better coffee shop experience.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe hope to welcome you back again very soon for another delightful visit!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThank you for supporting local! 787 Coffee is dedicated to empowering coffee farmers \u0026 communities. Enjoy our handpicked, fresh coffee – \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThank you for supporting our farm-to-cup specialty coffee 🤍 We started in 2014 as coffee farmers, and that farmers-first mindset still guides everything we do today. Our hand-picked specialty coffee is grown with care, crafted with intention, and served by humans who truly respect coffee and nature. Reviews like yours help more people searching for the best coffee in NYC discover an authentic coffee experience built by farmers and powered by community. We’re grateful you drink coffee with us — stay caffeinated. Gracias, gracias, gracias ☕🌱\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhy do so many people say 787 Coffee has the best coffee in New York?\u003cbr\u003eBecause we grow, source, and serve specialty coffee through a true farm-to-cup process focused on quality and sustainability.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhat makes 787 Coffee different from other coffee shops?\u003cbr\u003eWe are farmers first, baristas second — which means we understand coffee from the soil to the cup.\u003cbr\u003e",null,"",null,null,null,null,"https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfMmUzQzNhMG1YRWZPZmlmanRSZC0zZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfMmUzQzNhMG1YRWZPZmlmanRSZC0zZxoTQ2d3SW1ObVJ6UVlROXVQY2dnTQ\u0026d\u003d286732336\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1"],"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ORmJXbGtjbE5UVnpSMlUyMW9SSGhZT1VsVWFsRRAB",null,null,null,null,"https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ORmJXbGtjbE5UVnpSMlUyMW9SSGhZT1VsVWFsRRAB\u0026d\u003d286732336\u0026t\u003d1\u0026wv\u003d1",null,"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ORmJXbGtjbE5UVnpSMlUyMW9SSGhZT1VsVWFsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa38e11c309a5d41e!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnNFbWlkclNTVzR2U21oRHhYOUlUalE%7C%7C?hl\u003den-GB",null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfK4vsfQTgCLs1MaSCGscRiEBwmMTuEUxgsvDZPl_M5Pa4LtZvB0r4j0b-iiydX6GrPyCDFtUwOI0q1vsDjsCCz3SjPDNEwr9URXGXAVGpBC8cnn2q9PCxUGt-RNTugl-viARi6D2nzbM8v\u003dk-no","","//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhDofCLJ1hYnLA9Q3fL7_9FX\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xa38e11c309a5d41e","CIABIhDofCLJ1hYnLA9Q3fL7_9FX",1.3333333333333333,null,"7 months ago"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeVDfmFP6ZqjKJFSHRhUIkvzGAJe