003d!1e10!2sCIABIhALqyzXpEMY9QuBUYHPwseE\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xa38e11c309a5d41e","CIABIhALqyzXpEMY9QuBUYHPwseE",1.3333333333333333,null,"3 months ago"]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"en","I saw this place on Instagram and knew I had to try it while I was in the city. Sydney helped me decide between some options and I ultimately went with her recommendation to try the iced horchata latte. It is amazing and well worth the walk here on a 90° day.","I saw this place on Instagram and knew I had to try it while I was in the city. Sydney helped me decide between some options and I ultimately went with her recommendation to try the iced horchata latte. It is amazing and well worth the walk here on a 90° day.",0,[[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"Food",null,null,null,"Food",null,null,null,null,null,[5],null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"Service",null,null,null,"Service",null,null,null,null,null,[5],null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"Atmosphere",null,null,null,"Atmosphere",null,null,null,null,null,[5],null,2]],null,"",null,1,[],"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google",[null,null,"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png"],null,null,1],5,5,[],[8114,"",null,3]],[null,2,["9 months ago",null,"1768173959224"],["Matt Sweetwood","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUvnbkYd7Saz7VEnCkJ0i9RZHHajQ8Bx2CHj21rBk8CK99qBzwQgg\u003ds64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110452599974688077516/reviews?hl\u003den-IN",347,3702,[null,1]],[null,"5 months ago","Hi Matt!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe're genuinely sorry to hear about your recent experience and that we fell short of your expectations during your visit.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe appreciate you bringing the espresso issue to our attention, especially regarding the 'double' and pricing. We want to ensure clarity on our menu and that our offerings meet expectations. We also regret that the m